[{"_1":2,"_3":4},"root",{"_5":92},"routes/item",{"_5":6},"data",{"_7":8},"item",{"_9":10,"_11":12,"_13":14,"_15":16,"_17":18,"_19":-5,"_20":21,"_22":23,"_24":25,"_26":27,"_28":-5,"_29":30,"_31":25,"_32":33,"_34":35,"_36":37,"_38":39,"_40":41,"_42":-5,"_41":43,"_44":45,"_46":-5,"_47":-5,"_48":49,"_50":51,"_52":53,"_54":55,"_56":57,"_58":59,"_60":39,"_61":62,"_63":-5,"_64":39,"_65":66},"id","ryse9k138pi2i7g16qpewscjr","revision",1,"title","亚马逊新手首单备货策略","originalTitle","A mistake new Amazon sellers make is they get excited about finding a good item and buy way too much of it before testing their actual se...","summary","亚马逊新卖家常犯的一个错误是，发现好产品后兴奋不已，在未测试实际售罄率前就大量进货。\n\n应采取“浅尝辄止、广泛撒网”的策略。首批发货建议总共约50件，分散在不同商品上。例如10个ASIN各发5件，或25个ASIN各发2件。\n\n如果某个链接因价格战失败或被重新分类导致费用增加，你的资金不会全部损失，同时也能了解产品在现实中的周转情况。","reason","source",{"_9":85,"_86":87,"_88":89,"_90":39,"_91":-5},"links",{"_82":83,"_66":84},"publishedAt","2026-10-07T12:00:47.000Z","publishedPrecision","timestamp","calendarDate","discoveredAt","2026-10-17T16:14:18.270Z","timelineAt","category","advertising","tags",[80,81],"score",38,"selected",false,"channel","x","story",{"_71":72,"_73":51,"_74":75,"_76":77,"_78":-5,"_44":79},"media",[],"byline","detailedGuide","readingMode","full","author","askjimmysmith","language","en","body",{"_67":-5,"_66":68,"_69":-5,"_70":62},"outline",[],"relatedStories",[],"indexable","markdownAvailable",true,"group","hasTranslation","bodyLanguage","original","zh","<p>A mistake new Amazon sellers make is they get excited about finding a good item and buy way too much of it before testing their actual sell-through rate.</p><p>Go an inch deep and a mile wide instead. On your first shipment, aim for roughly 50 units total spread across different items. That could be 5 units of 10 ASINs, or 2 units of 25 ASINs.</p><p>If a listing tanks on price or gets reclassified with higher fees, your capital is not wiped out, and you learn how products turn in real life.</p>","zhKind","complete","authorName","Jimmy Smith","handle","avatarUrl","/amznews-reading-preview/_img/missing.svg","avatarSrcSet","/amznews-reading-preview/_img/missing.svg 48w, /amznews-reading-preview/_img/missing.svg 96w","quoted",[],"广告/运营","选品/市场","aihot","/items/ryse9k138pi2i7g16qpewscjr","https://x.com/askjimmysmith/status/2107803321620644189","x-jimmy-smith","name","X · Jimmy Smith","kind","x_search","firstParty","iconUrl",{"_93":94},"changelogVersion","2026-10-09T22:08"]
